{"title":"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(casework,_not_recommended)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (casework, not recommended)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible o by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for any integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Lemma 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by 4</b><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b433a5983444700091fdcd791a088cdccfc6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 (n+1)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/2/b52c9ec9ac8097417e4f2610dbcbec57086822c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"19\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77eb0c927773ed1b909a0d12b086879d925df5be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/45571e7028f2d98706de0addc00c36927191dbfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3ebc23b7b9c8796d68f052081f8e873949b98ff1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 3 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/90656322b3eaa466d9b7e6708f1e1db460543910.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.  That means for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b433a5983444700091fdcd791a088cdccfc6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 (n+1)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Lemma 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by 3</b><br />\nAgain, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b433a5983444700091fdcd791a088cdccfc6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 (n+1)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1e98d144514989484036a3122ce2aec6c1ac257.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 0 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/9/3a90cf7377e02edd0261ab2f3aad40c826bc83fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"19\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e0cb3b40200856bf02df3c0604e1598550ce0ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55cb23a47e6ba2e975c8e57d64eb3298b93dab1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/5/5f5cbead4d646c454c8dea87c89076d7f30e961f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 2 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c97d3f5c17307ae8c13ab3c30b67f9109523fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1 \\equiv 0 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.  That means for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b433a5983444700091fdcd791a088cdccfc6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 (n+1)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24af398b952b7f08a2fabbc59c8de69dd1ceda8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 - m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/42797fa35299506c8ea525706c93242f41d4912e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 = m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />. The case 0 is trivial.\nThe squares of 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 mod 12 are 1, 4, 9, 4, 1, 0. The rest are symmetric. For m = 0 (0), 1 (1), 4 (12), and 9 (72) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24af398b952b7f08a2fabbc59c8de69dd1ceda8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 - m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> is divisible by 12. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d4908884ff49039f6546f69e4946f5c20a9949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4 - n^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by 12.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28casework.2C_not_recommended.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(casework,_not_recommended)\">Solution 3 (casework, not recommended)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (casework, not recommended)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We proceed with casework.\nCase 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d13d1aa01dc7d8ac0a7c60387f9cc87ce3ce2619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nEvaluating the expression, we see that the expression is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be13e9e429726b7303c23fb919b26245d608137c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0-0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc7cddac96904df29627223ab4cb43c35fdd98f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv1\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nEvaluating the expression, we see that the expression is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e7806e834497a65acca6b041f829c21fb42d6217.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-1\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 3: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/f/cafba2d61f283943077625fd6a032dc0c7d04c72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv2\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nEvaluating the expression, we see that the expression is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d597a49cbbc861f9975caaf306ffa2f245362fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16-4\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 4: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6c746590fbcf8220457b979fbb66297a6ccc94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv3\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nEvaluating the expression, we see that the expression is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f718293865d0ec4446e700a9f571caecdc0e482d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81-9\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>From here onwards, the numbers will get messy and large, so we factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/209a11d73c6149fd3ec3b530f8940256fa655413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4-n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/73402d32d169dad44562347742643e8bef16fd87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2(n+1)(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Case 5: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a439fe7f50e02a0bd54a83ae6885fe9838e9fe03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv4\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e80614cbaa3394464c786126bb474591b1c6a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2\\equiv4\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea3622f11a3724630cff690a4650a322198562a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1\\equiv3\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 6: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/20449e151ba7cf5c5b13d35eab0d1ff7269ef009.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv5\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/20910a1896a3687ba8964bfff0d3434a59e72f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1\\equiv6\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d4904352f0919a0151d0eba78d68f2efc94b64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1\\equiv4\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 7: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5e92914fda749faf500d0322634326273a559fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv6\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/73060a32497a996b99e6bc6fa160e6974890e703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2\\equiv0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" />, so the whole expression is, as well.\n</p><p>Case 8: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/effbae7c0ef59e4d3f946589d24a5da8f4e934a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv7\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11cd1f07954ae22e063442bda2c7914053abbb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1\\equiv8\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3d292afb60ba06772a1939f49f24404feaa9ecb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1\\equiv6\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 9: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12b590f7a6bca61bebdf84697aa553a162bae6c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv8\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db08ad988cd2a63eee5ca160978f04174b2567f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1\\equiv9\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e96c3f8122c51ccf04d73b6d5116f0b84d3292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2\\equiv8\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 10: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/3/203857fe0d5d584f0fd4e6773356613bb2c66fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv9\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43bbcc11427f44732d7035a8509b27d219e2b88d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2\\equiv9\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7ae32537b43d8bfd4bb476bebf162d26683c643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1\\equiv8\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 11: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14c0c797209a3832bddc1319711011a4c1ff5e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv10\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e80614cbaa3394464c786126bb474591b1c6a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2\\equiv4\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d2f869f798b51e2e1138197423cb237af6cd182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1\\equiv9\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, and multiplying them gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4f29cdeb25b1b9697c03285ee5e97aaef579d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 12: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cd1c2c14446d62c71197b8de7fe1d3990ba85aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv11\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/1/701475db81917b95b796c27f5c9a4dbdabc6897f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1\\equiv0\\pmod{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />, so the whole expression is, as well.\n</p><p>Since all integers can be expressed as one of the above cases, we are done. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO\">2002 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\